questions.question_es:
¿Qué imprime el siguiente código?

```python
def aplanar(xs):
    salida = []
    for x in xs:
        if isinstance(x, list):
            salida += aplanar(x)
        else:
            salida.append(x)
    return salida

print(aplanar([1, [2, [3]]]))
```

